            <ArticleTitle>[A prospective multicenter study of appendicitis treatment].</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>267-80</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>Between 1.7. 1988-31. 12. 1989 in 18 surgical departments of the former GDR 6, 266 patients suffering from &quot;appendicitis&quot; were registered and qualitatively evaluated. The perforation rate was 8.3%. 30% of these patients had no typical diagnosis. Postoperative lethality was 0.32%.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
